<title>UK: Freddie Mac sets $52.5 million three-year bond.</title>
<headline>Freddie Mac sets $52.5 million three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Merrill Lynch International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FEDERAL HOME LOAN MORTGAGE CORP</p>
<p> AMT	  $52.5 MLN COUPON     6.00	MATURITY    26.JUN.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    26.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.80	LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  U.S.	TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
